<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/"><channel><title>AI on BigJeager</title><link>https://bigjeager.github.io/tags/ai/</link><description>Recent content in AI on BigJeager</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>zh-CN</language><lastBuildDate>Sat, 26 Sep 2026 10:30:00 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://bigjeager.github.io/tags/ai/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>🎵 Singlish：一个 vibe coding 出来的「听歌背单词」应用</title><link>https://bigjeager.github.io/posts/singtheword-vibe-coding/</link><pubDate>Fri, 25 Sep 2026 02:30:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://bigjeager.github.io/posts/singtheword-vibe-coding/</guid><description>每个雅思单词都藏在一段流行歌里：Apple Music 官方试听 + 卡拉 OK 同步歌词。从公版儿歌到 YouTube 再到 Apple 试听，推倒重来三次的 vibe coding 实录</description></item><item><title>Hermes Agent 架构解读（六）：状态管理</title><link>https://bigjeager.github.io/posts/hermes-architecture-6-state/</link><pubDate>Sat, 09 May 2026 10:35:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://bigjeager.github.io/posts/hermes-architecture-6-state/</guid><description>&lt;h2 id="状态管理概述">状态管理概述&lt;/h2>
&lt;p>Hermes 的状态管理包含：&lt;/p>
&lt;ul>
&lt;li>&lt;strong>Session&lt;/strong>: 会话历史持久化&lt;/li>
&lt;li>&lt;strong>Memory&lt;/strong>: 跨会话记忆&lt;/li>
&lt;li>&lt;strong>Config&lt;/strong>: 用户配置&lt;/li>
&lt;/ul>
&lt;h2 id="session-会话管理">Session 会话管理&lt;/h2>
&lt;h3 id="数据库结构">数据库结构&lt;/h3>
&lt;p>&lt;code>hermes_state.py&lt;/code> 使用 SQLite + FTS5：&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-python" data-lang="python">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="ln"> 1&lt;/span>&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="c1"># hermes_state.py (约 2,600 行)&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="ln"> 2&lt;/span>&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="k">class&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nc">SessionDB&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">:&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="ln"> 3&lt;/span>&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="k">def&lt;/span> &lt;span class="fm">__init__&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="bp">self&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">db_path&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">=&lt;/span>&lt;span class="kc">None&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">):&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="ln"> 4&lt;/span>&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="k">if&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">db_path&lt;/span> &lt;span class="ow">is&lt;/span> &lt;span class="kc">None&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">:&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="ln"> 5&lt;/span>&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="n">db_path&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">=&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">os&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">.&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">path&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">.&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">join&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">get_hermes_home&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(),&lt;/span> &lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;sessions.db&amp;#34;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">)&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="ln"> 6&lt;/span>&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="bp">self&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">.&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">conn&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">=&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">sqlite3&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">.&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">connect&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">db_path&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">)&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="ln"> 7&lt;/span>&lt;span class="cl">
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="ln"> 8&lt;/span>&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="c1"># 消息表&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="ln"> 9&lt;/span>&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="bp">self&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">.&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">conn&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">.&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">execute&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;&amp;#34;&amp;#34;
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="ln">10&lt;/span>&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="s2"> CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS messages (
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="ln">11&lt;/span>&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="s2"> id INTEGER PRIMARY KEY,
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="ln">12&lt;/span>&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="s2"> session_id TEXT,
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="ln">13&lt;/span>&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="s2"> role TEXT,
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="ln">14&lt;/span>&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="s2"> content TEXT,
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="ln">15&lt;/span>&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="s2"> timestamp REAL,
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="ln">16&lt;/span>&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="s2"> tool_calls TEXT,
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="ln">17&lt;/span>&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="s2"> tool_results TEXT
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="ln">18&lt;/span>&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="s2"> )
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="ln">19&lt;/span>&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="s2"> &amp;#34;&amp;#34;&amp;#34;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">)&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="ln">20&lt;/span>&lt;span class="cl">
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="ln">21&lt;/span>&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="c1"># FTS5 全文搜索&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="ln">22&lt;/span>&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="bp">self&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">.&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">conn&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">.&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">execute&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;&amp;#34;&amp;#34;
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="ln">23&lt;/span>&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="s2"> CREATE VIRTUAL TABLE IF NOT EXISTS messages_fts
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="ln">24&lt;/span>&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="s2"> USING fts5(content, tokenize=&amp;#39;unicode61&amp;#39;)
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="ln">25&lt;/span>&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="s2"> &amp;#34;&amp;#34;&amp;#34;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">)&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/div>&lt;h3 id="核心方法">核心方法&lt;/h3>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-python" data-lang="python">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="ln"> 1&lt;/span>&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="k">def&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nf">save_message&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="bp">self&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">session_id&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">role&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">content&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">**&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">metadata&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">):&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="ln"> 2&lt;/span>&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;&amp;#34;&amp;#34;保存消息到会话&amp;#34;&amp;#34;&amp;#34;&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="ln"> 3&lt;/span>&lt;span class="cl">
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="ln"> 4&lt;/span>&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="k">def&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nf">get_messages&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="bp">self&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">session_id&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">limit&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">=&lt;/span>&lt;span class="kc">None&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">offset&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">=&lt;/span>&lt;span class="kc">None&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">):&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="ln"> 5&lt;/span>&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;&amp;#34;&amp;#34;获取会话历史&amp;#34;&amp;#34;&amp;#34;&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="ln"> 6&lt;/span>&lt;span class="cl">
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="ln"> 7&lt;/span>&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="k">def&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nf">search_sessions&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="bp">self&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">query&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">limit&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">=&lt;/span>&lt;span class="mi">10&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">):&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="ln"> 8&lt;/span>&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;&amp;#34;&amp;#34;全文搜索历史对话&amp;#34;&amp;#34;&amp;#34;&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="ln"> 9&lt;/span>&lt;span class="cl">
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="ln">10&lt;/span>&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="k">def&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nf">get_recent_sessions&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="bp">self&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">limit&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">=&lt;/span>&lt;span class="mi">10&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">):&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="ln">11&lt;/span>&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;&amp;#34;&amp;#34;获取最近会话&amp;#34;&amp;#34;&amp;#34;&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="ln">12&lt;/span>&lt;span class="cl">
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="ln">13&lt;/span>&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="k">def&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nf">delete_session&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="bp">self&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">session_id&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">):&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="ln">14&lt;/span>&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;&amp;#34;&amp;#34;删除会话&amp;#34;&amp;#34;&amp;#34;&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="ln">15&lt;/span>&lt;span class="cl">
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="ln">16&lt;/span>&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="k">def&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nf">export_session&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="bp">self&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">session_id&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nb">format&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">=&lt;/span>&lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;json&amp;#34;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">):&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="ln">17&lt;/span>&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;&amp;#34;&amp;#34;导出会话&amp;#34;&amp;#34;&amp;#34;&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/div>&lt;h2 id="session_search-工具">session_search 工具&lt;/h2>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-python" data-lang="python">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="ln"> 1&lt;/span>&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="c1"># tools/session_search_tool.py&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="ln"> 2&lt;/span>&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="k">def&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nf">session_search&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">query&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">=&lt;/span>&lt;span class="kc">None&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">limit&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">=&lt;/span>&lt;span class="mi">3&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">role_filter&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">=&lt;/span>&lt;span class="kc">None&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">):&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="ln"> 3&lt;/span>&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;&amp;#34;&amp;#34;搜索历史对话
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="ln"> 4&lt;/span>&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="s2">
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="ln"> 5&lt;/span>&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="s2"> Args:
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="ln"> 6&lt;/span>&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="s2"> query: 搜索关键词 (None 时返回最近会话)
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="ln"> 7&lt;/span>&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="s2"> limit: 返回数量
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="ln"> 8&lt;/span>&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="s2"> role_filter: 角色过滤 (如 &amp;#34;user,assistant&amp;#34;)
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="ln"> 9&lt;/span>&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="s2">
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="ln">10&lt;/span>&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="s2"> Returns:
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="ln">11&lt;/span>&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="s2"> 会话摘要列表
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="ln">12&lt;/span>&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="s2"> &amp;#34;&amp;#34;&amp;#34;&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/div>&lt;p>使用示例：&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>Hermes Agent 架构解读（五）：技能系统</title><link>https://bigjeager.github.io/posts/hermes-architecture-5-skills/</link><pubDate>Sat, 09 May 2026 10:34:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://bigjeager.github.io/posts/hermes-architecture-5-skills/</guid><description>&lt;h2 id="技能系统概述">技能系统概述&lt;/h2>
&lt;p>技能是 Hermes 的&lt;strong>知识注入机制&lt;/strong>，允许为特定任务场景提供：&lt;/p>
&lt;ul>
&lt;li>专用指令&lt;/li>
&lt;li>工作流程&lt;/li>
&lt;li>参考文档&lt;/li>
&lt;li>脚本和模板&lt;/li>
&lt;/ul>
&lt;h2 id="技能目录结构">技能目录结构&lt;/h2>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-text" data-lang="text">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">skills/
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">├── autonomous-ai-agents/
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">│ ├── claude-code/SKILL.md
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">│ ├── codex/SKILL.md
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">│ ├── hermes-agent/SKILL.md
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">│ └── ...
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">├── creative/
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">│ ├── ascii-art/SKILL.md
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">│ ├── pixel-art/SKILL.md
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">│ └── ...
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">├── mlops/
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">│ ├── whisper/SKILL.md
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">│ ├── llama-cpp/SKILL.md
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">│ └── ...
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">├── software-development/
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">│ ├── writing-plans/SKILL.md
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">│ ├── systematic-debugging/SKILL.md
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">│ └── ...
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">└── ... (约 27 个类别)
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">optional-skills/ # 较大/小众技能，默认不激活
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">~/.hermes/skills/ # 用户自定义技能
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/div>&lt;h2 id="skillmd-格式">SKILL.md 格式&lt;/h2>
&lt;p>每个技能是一个目录，包含 &lt;code>SKILL.md&lt;/code> 文件：&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>Hermes Agent 架构解读（四）：Gateway 网关</title><link>https://bigjeager.github.io/posts/hermes-architecture-4-gateway/</link><pubDate>Sat, 09 May 2026 10:33:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://bigjeager.github.io/posts/hermes-architecture-4-gateway/</guid><description>&lt;h2 id="gateway-概述">Gateway 概述&lt;/h2>
&lt;p>Gateway 是 Hermes 的消息平台网关，负责：&lt;/p>
&lt;ul>
&lt;li>启动和管理各平台适配器&lt;/li>
&lt;li>消息收发和路由&lt;/li>
&lt;li>会话生命周期管理&lt;/li>
&lt;li>斜杠命令处理&lt;/li>
&lt;/ul>
&lt;p>核心文件：&lt;code>gateway/run.py&lt;/code>（约 15,000 行）&lt;/p>
&lt;h2 id="平台适配器">平台适配器&lt;/h2>
&lt;p>&lt;code>gateway/platforms/&lt;/code> 包含约 25+ 平台适配器：&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-text" data-lang="text">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">platforms/
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">├── telegram.py # Telegram Bot API
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">├── discord.py # Discord Bot
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">├── slack.py # Slack App
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">├── signal.py # Signal
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">├── matrix.py # Matrix
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">├── whatsapp.py # WhatsApp
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">├── weixin.py # 微信
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">├── wecom.py # 企业微信
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">├── feishu.py # 飞书
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">├── dingtalk.py # 钉钉
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">├── qqbot/ # QQ Bot
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">├── email.py # Email (IMAP/SMTP)
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">├── sms.py # SMS
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">├── homeassistant.py # Home Assistant
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">├── yuanbao.py # 腾讯元宝
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">├── webhook.py # Webhook
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">├── api_server.py # REST API
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">└── ...
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/div>&lt;h3 id="基类设计">基类设计&lt;/h3>
